      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a95256f54d514123c1f089d|full_name}: I completely agree with you, I was going to submit this sort of idea but looks like I was beaten, I would say to only allow people who have trusted rank to be able to apply for a player mod status, obiously ever action taken would need to be either Recorded by the mod or logged in a automated logging system so vrc staff can take a look at and see if it was legitamate reason for the ban, as for abusing power, player mods should be able to see other player mods to make it easier to see if another mod is in the lobby, If another mod see's them abusing they should be able to report it live via a Abuse button and have it automatically ping an actual staff member who is in the game.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
